    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπάλλομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dart down</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρπῃ ἐϊκυῖα . . οὐρανοῦ ἒκ
				κατέπαλτο</span> (
				Ep.
			
			aor. 2) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.351
			</span></i> (but this form shd. perh. be referred to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεφάλλομαι</span>, q. v.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νὺξ φυγὰς οὐρανόθεν καταπάλλεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Berol.</u>
					2.95
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑοῦ κατεπήλατο
				δίφρου</span>
			<i>leapt down from</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				18.13
			</span></i>.</div>
